#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:122
#: bcd7b8e211344301b144b99631491967
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:123
#: ea275d9f5ea8417e9251afce973a1979
msgid "GPIO 81 controls the Vsw pins which can be set to output either VFC (9/12V) or 5V via a board jumper. Setting this GPIO high removes voltage supply to pins. RELAY2 is configured by default to control this GPIO and is low by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:125
#: 91ab7850c3f745208a5f0b5914b467cc
msgid "GPIO 83 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"9V/12V\"  included on the HD VTX connector and VFC pads and is included on the HD VTX connector. Setting this GPIO low removes voltage supply to this pin/pad. By default RELAY4 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:129
#: e5e47770d46c411295efe44cda62b97e
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:130
#: 186522f4983540a2aace4ca4993df317
msgid "GPIO 82 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"C1\" and \"C2\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video input from C1 to C2. By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:133
#: 6640b10f4de54882b9323bf20a79492e
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:134
#: 590fbd96d51c422cb91825dd2c77194a
msgid "The TBS Lucid H7 Wing does not come with ArduPilot firmware pre-installed. Use the instructions here to load ArduPilot the first time :ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`. Firmware for the TBS Lucid H7 Wing can be found `here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in sub-folders labeled “TBS_LUCID_H7_WING\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:137
#: 10d758d6b02e4e65adc27cb9d6f09974
msgid "Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucid-h7-wing.rst:141
#: e07f4bec24ef405ab1850c9fe28d302b
msgid "Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr ""
